## Tool mapping

- **Slidev**: tokens in `styles/index.css`; custom layouts in `layouts/`; fonts via `public/fonts/` + `@font-face`.
- **Bento / OpenSlide**: map tokens to their theme/config format; keep the same scale ratios.

